---
// 首屏：介绍 + 样例对页 + 装订图解
const nPatterns = 9;
const nSizes = 3;
const nSamples = 27;
---
<header id="intro" class="wrap">
  <div class="intro-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">手帐版式生成器 · LATEX / TIKZ</p>
      <h1>一版既成，<br />整本装订。</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        base6-techo 用 LaTeX 排出毫米级精度的手帐内页：<em>装订边与外翻边自动区分</em>，
        页码、页眉、水印随奇偶页镜像，多个版式按序拼成一本可直接装订的 PDF。
        本页陈列它的全部基础与复刻版式——按真实比例展示，每份样张
        都可一键导入桌面应用继续微调。
      </p>
      <ul class="facts">
        <li><b>{nPatterns}</b>种版式</li>
        <li><b>{nSizes}</b>种尺寸</li>
        <li><b>{nSamples}</b>份样张</li>
        <li><b>mm</b>级版面控制</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <figure class="hero-spread">
      <div class="spread">
        <img
          src="/examples/hakubunkan-kaichu-nikki/a5/hakubunkan-kaichu-nikki-a5-p-2.png"
          width="875" height="1241" alt="博文館・懐中日記 A5 样张第 2 页" class="page left" />
        <img
          src="/examples/hakubunkan-kaichu-nikki/a5/hakubunkan-kaichu-nikki-a5-p-3.png"
          width="875" height="1241" alt="博文館・懐中日記 A5 样张第 3 页" class="page right" />
        <i class="gutter" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      </div>
      <figcaption>
        <span class="mono cap-label">hakubunkan-kaichu-nikki · A5 对页</span>
        <span class="cap-text">装订侧的 <span class="mono">base6</span> 水印随页码奇偶镜像，居于中缝两侧——摊开即是一本装订好的手帐。</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>

  <div class="binding-demo">
    <div class="demo-pages">
      <div class="demo-page">
        <i class="strip outer"></i>
        <span class="demo-fill"></span>
        <i class="strip binding"></i>
      </div>
      <div class="demo-page">
        <i class="strip binding"></i>
        <span class="demo-fill"></span>
        <i class="strip outer"></i>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-labels-row" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="demo-labels mono" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="l-outer">外</span>
        <span></span>
        <span class="l-binding">内</span>
      </div>
      <div class="demo-labels mono" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="l-binding">内</span>
        <span></span>
        <span class="l-outer">外</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-legend mono">
      <span><i class="swatch binding"></i>装订边（内）· 窄</span>
      <span><i class="swatch outer"></i>外翻边（外）· 宽</span>
    </div>
    <p class="demo-note">
      装订边向内让位、外翻边向外放宽；页码、页眉与装订侧水印随页码奇偶自动镜像。
    </p>
  </div>
</header>
